<title>GERMANY: Walter Bau expects acceptable 97 results.</title>
<headline>Walter Bau expects acceptable 97 results.</headline>
<dateline>AUGSBURG, Germany 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction group Walter Bau AG said on Friday it expected acceptable results in 1997 at both the group and parent levels.</p>
<p>The construction group, in comments at its annual general meeting, also said group construction output during the first five months of the year was up 10 percent at 1.76 billion marks.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
